# OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID from Google Cloud Console (APIs & Services > Credentials).
# Enable the Google Drive API and add http://localhost:5173 as an authorized JavaScript origin.
# Can also be entered at runtime on the Settings page.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Browser API key for the Google Picker ("Import from Google Drive…", to open existing Google Docs, Word,
# text, Markdown or HTML files). Create it in the same Cloud project as the client ID, enable the
# "Google Picker API", restrict the key to websites http://localhost:5173/* (plus your host's origin)
# and https://docs.google.com/*, and to the Google Picker API only. Can also be entered on the Settings page.
# Never synced to Drive.
VITE_GOOGLE_API_KEY=
